<title>POLAND: Amerbank moves 1.5-mln-shr issue to June.</title>
<headline>Amerbank moves 1.5-mln-shr issue to June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Poland's Amerbank SA decided to move the subscription period for its 1.5 million new share issue at 21 zlotys per share to June 9-20 from May 5-23, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
